+For example...
+
+```python
+# Use `SSL_CERT_FILE` or `SSL_CERT_DIR` if configured, otherwise use certifi.
+verify = os.environ.get("SSL_CERT_FILE", os.environ.get("SSL_CERT_DIR", True))
+ssl_context = httpx.SSLContext(verify=verify)
+```
